match means the .elc on disk was built from precisely these parts, so
loading it is provably identical to evaluating them fresh."
  (secure-hash 'sha256
               (mapconcat (lambda (p)
                            (concat (symbol-name (plist-get p :kind)) "\0"
                                    (format "%s" (or (plist-get p :name) ""))
                                    "\0"
                                    (plist-get p :body) "\0"))
